==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|πᾶν|t=all}} + {{m|grc|ὀπτικός|t=visible}}. {{coin|en|Jeremy Bentham|nat=English|occ=philosopher|in=1791}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A type of [[prison]] where all the [[cell]]s are visible from the center, particularly if it is not possible for someone in a cell to know if they are being watched.
# A room for the exhibition of novelties.

